{
 "name": "boat_pinbanzhou_ling",
 "_variant": "3D 量產卷批 1 · 拼板舟（ab=boat、祖靈 zuling、swarm ×3、trait swarmHalfSplash）。模板＝assets/creatures/tiger_c.json 的『語彙』（硬轉折、炭黑底＋一條高飽和系別色帶、1–3 個發光材質、識別視角＝側視），造型不沿用。",
 "_brief": "Tatala boat-spirit: a Tao (Yami) plank canoe that grew flying-fish wings. Charcoal plank hull, both ends wrenched upward, the bow far higher and knifed to a point; one hard gold band runs the gunwale, a bone sheer-rail caps it and three thwarts bridge the black open hull; the painted boat-eye on each bow cheek is a glowing gold pupil in a black socket ringed with bone. Two long bone pectoral fins sweep back off the flanks like a flying fish clearing the water. Feel: a drowned vessel that still hunts. Signature = the up-hooked pointed prow. Identity view = side.",
 "_swarm_recipe": "第一隻 swarm，骨架與體積寫法給其餘 6 隻 swarm 沿用：① 主鏈水平臥（frame:up）、模型高 ≤0.85、W/H ≥1.4，橫排 3 隻時 preview 每隻只有 1.05/0.62≈1.69 模型單位的 X 額度 → 含配件的總寬務必 ≤1.2；② 左右對稱靠一對 mirror 側鏈（本檔 LFin），動畫不寫 mirror_phase，兩側同拍才讀得出『一群同款』；③ 高飽和系別色帶用 colors.arcs 的縱向分帶（角度吸附到 360/sides 的格，本檔 sides=16 → 22.5° 一格），不要用 fin 貼片做橫紋。",
 "_glow_materials": "eye / glow_prow —— 材質名是給 three.js 接 emissive 用的（簡報指定的兩個發光部位）。這份 spec 只把它們塗成高亮高飽和色。",
 "_traps": "① 近黑一律用中性灰（S<0.15），shading.noise 會把偏暖的近黑擾到 HSV S>0.5，飽和面積就爆掉；② fin 帶 anchor 時 offset 會被丟掉，要埋只能把 points 內緣寫成負 u；③ 鏈段長度比 >0.923 會被 proportion BLOCK，每段都刻意做長短差。",

